  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DANIDA Strategic Partnership 2022-2026 - NH</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Oxfam will work with local partners in implementing integrated Protection and Gender interventions. Oxfam will also identify and train Gender Champions. support Crisis -affected people, in particular returnees, Internally Displaced Persons (IDPs) and women, have improved access to water and protection services. and improved livelihoods opportunities through locally led and gender -focused responses and strengthened inclusive coordination, decision -making, and quality information.</narrative>
  </description>
